{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_018S9xt6nXdaprsRMAjv9EUz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full paper and the review context. Let me dispatch two reviewers in parallel as specified by the dream-review-full skill template:\n\n- R1: Methods + Experiments\n- R2: Novelty + Related Work\n\nThen I'll run the 4-step roundtable and submit the consolidated report.\n\nLet me carefully analyze the paper first, then launch both reviewers.\n\nThe paper: \"Large-Scale Item-Level Stability Analysis of LLM Benchmarks\"\n\nKey content:\n- Applies MH-DIF (nonparametric group-comparison test) to METABENCH (5,227 models × 12,508 MMLU items)\n\n\n- Finds that roughly a third of items show instability between the 2023 and 2024 cohorts, but permutation testing reveals about half of this is just due to changing model composition, leaving an effective instability rate around 15% for MMLU\n- Replicates across multiple benchmarks with varying rates, validates findings with semi-synthetic data and cross-subject matching, tests robustness against reasoning-based RL which shows significant destabilization, and compares three different detection methods that identify largely non-overlapping sets of problematic items\n- IRT models fail to fit the data well, ensemble approaches don't help, synthetic item generation doesn't solve the problem, and removing items at this scale isn't feasible, though item-level properties explain far more variance in the instability than raw accuracy changes do\n\nNow I'm setting up two parallel reviewer agents—one to scrutinize the experimental methodology and statistical rigor, the other to evaluate the novelty and positioning relative to existing work.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15147,"cache_read_input_tokens":43822,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15147},"output_tokens":18,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"443e7d3b-018c-4cf7-ba4a-be177b1d8eb5","uuid":"d9c532b2-346f-439a-8d76-2aed239e3827"}
